        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You meet a creature's eyes and let it feel, briefly and completely, how small it is against what you serve. <i>Failure</i> the target takes 1d4 mental damage (<b>Heightened +1d4</b>: the damage increases by 1d4 at 3rd level and every 2 levels thereafter). <i>Critical Failure</i> as failure, and the target is off-guard until the start of its next turn. <i>Success</i> no effect. It fades fast. The feeling of having been seen does not.</p>"
